  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Municipality of Pristina opened an international competition for the redevelopment of the G&#xeb;rmia building into a Multi Cultural Centre including exhibitions space, concert halls, retail and catering space as well as areas for meetings, conferences and education. It sought to address several interlinked development challenges related to cultural preservation, social cohesion, economic development, and environmental sustainability, with the ultimate goal to serving the communities.</narrative>
  </description>
